{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game With Balls! A little collection of handcrafted mazes for the Steam Deck, where you use gyro movement to navigate one of the balls through them. Are you the one with the best time among your friends\u2014or even in the world?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMPORTANT: Game With Balls can only be played on a Steam Deck or with a controller that supports gyro. Tested with PS5 and Switch Pro controller. Keyboard and mouse are not supported.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/98d35de559c12bad793f83f22f36f0a5.poster.avif?t=1768916698\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/98d35de559c12bad793f83f22f36f0a5.webm?t=1768916698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/98d35de559c12bad793f83f22f36f0a5.mp4?t=1768916698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 levels handcrafted in the real world using real wood, drawings, and other materials, then converted for your digital pleasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An additional 10 challenges that not only test you on the time it takes to complete each level but also on other objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keeps track of your fastest times using Steam Leaderboards, so you can see if you\u2019re the quickest among your friends\u2014or the fastest in the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all secrets in every level to not only be the fastest but also the ultimate completist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack to relax to (or maybe not when you\u2019re trying to beat your friends\u2019 times).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned to have new mazes added througout 2026! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/2bf9bdf95b8f5681c66d641a9b14ccf6.poster.avif?t=1768916698\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/2bf9bdf95b8f5681c66d641a9b14ccf6.webm?t=1768916698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/2bf9bdf95b8f5681c66d641a9b14ccf6.mp4?t=1768916698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/92bc4fa1db15e8f98e6f988a2bbfef0f.poster.avif?t=1768916698\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/92bc4fa1db15e8f98e6f988a2bbfef0f.webm?t=1768916698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/92bc4fa1db15e8f98e6f988a2bbfef0f.mp4?t=1768916698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745250?t=1768916698","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745250?t=1768916698","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/9c78311b617726156e2ed987e1d03300e104923a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768916698","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse