u on the time it takes to complete each level but also on other objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keeps track of your fastest times using Steam Leaderboards, so you can see if you\u2019re the quickest among your friends\u2014or the fastest in the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all secrets in every level to not only be the fastest but also the ultimate completist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack to relax to (or maybe not when you\u2019re trying to beat your friends\u2019 times).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned to have new mazes added througout 2026! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/2bf9bdf95b8f5681c66d641a9b14ccf6.poster.avif?t=1768916698\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/2bf9bdf95b8f5681c66d641a9b14ccf6.webm?t=1768916698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/2bf9bdf95b8f5681c66d641a9b14ccf6.mp4?t=1768916698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/92bc4fa1db15e8f98e6f988a2bbfef0f.poster.avif?t=1768916698\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/92bc4fa1db15e8f98e6f988a2bbfef0f.webm?t=1768916698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/92bc4fa1db15e8f98e6f988a2bbfef0f.mp4?t=1768916698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vide